// Checking whether it's Even or not!?

for (let i = 1; i <= 20; i++) {
    if (i % 2 === 0) {
        console.log(i);
    }
}

The loop starts from 1 and goes up to 20.
Each time it checks whether the number is even using % 2 === 0. 
If it is even, it prints the number. Then i++ increases the number by 1, and the loop keeps repeating until it reaches 20.
